<body>
    <h1>Cardiff Dev01 / Dev02 Server Swap for AI+</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Currently in Cardiff, the team requires switching AI+ node to po=
int to a different Vision instance.</p>
<p></p>
<p>Step 1 - Stop the services ( at the time of writing this, we are working=
 with NotifiationAPI and Transcribe Summarize</p>
<p>On AI+ Admin <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://10.20.1.73:8080/s=
ervers" rel=3D"nofollow">http://10.20.1.73:8080/servers</a> go to =E2=80=9C=
Manage=E2=80=9D</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-ce=
nter-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embe=
dded-image image-center" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"8627a4459e92=
84fb2017c9c63f5da4147ad05b77cc45d5df20243e881c3ad854" data-image-src=3D"htt=
ps://perifery.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/4421386252/Screenshot=
%202025-08-22%20at%2011.09.06%E2%80%AFAM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDa=
te=3D1755875389511&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"947" d=
ata-width=3D"1045" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource=
-id=3D"4421189638" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-=
type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2025-0=
8-22 at 11.09.06=E2=80=AFAM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://perifery.atlassia=
n.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-res=
ource-container-id=3D"4421386252" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D=
"2" data-media-id=3D"0d835e5f-e463-4c86-adfe-fca6cc8d3dbc" data-media-type=
=3D"file" height=3D"423"></span>
<p>Click the stop button on =E2=80=9Cnotification-api-aiplus-notification-a=
pi-1=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9Ctranscribe-summarize-aiplus-transcribe-summarize=
-1=E2=80=9D</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center=
-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded=
-image image-center" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"41040cb1bb0c3d97=
8cb3f64e85e8233e1843e9ab3041e0c8f95932cad608b7d8" data-image-src=3D"https:/=
/perifery.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/4421386252/Screenshot%202=
025-08-22%20at%2011.10.03%E2%80%AFAM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
=3D1755875465583&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"916" dat=
a-width=3D"1809" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-i=
d=3D"4421615617" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-ty=
pe=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2025-08-=
22 at 11.10.03=E2=80=AFAM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.=
net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-id=3D"4421386252" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"2=
" data-media-id=3D"066f6f1f-d27f-4292-bdd3-df0c268579d5" data-media-type=3D=
"file" height=3D"236"></span>
<p></p>
<p>Step 2 - Remove current mount and Remount with target Server (160 or 162=
 for example):</p>
<p>Reference <a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" hre=
f=3D"https://arcapix.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~bevans/pages/5089165411/NFS=
+Export+for+AI" rel=3D"nofollow">https://arcapix.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/=
~bevans/pages/5089165411/NFS+Export+for+AI</a></p>
<p></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">sudo um=
ount /mmfs1=20

sudo mount 10.20.0.{160/162}:/mmfs1 /mmfs1=20

#validate the mount
mount | grep /mmfs1
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Step 3 - Reconfigure Rabbit for both NotificationAPI and TranscribeSumma=
rize</p>
<p>Click on =E2=80=9CConfigurations=E2=80=9D and you will see the two servi=
ces listed:</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center=
-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded=
-image image-center" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"905455196e1fb758=
4841b2d6c3d864847ccc528a082a45837a35fd59a9dea641" data-image-src=3D"https:/=
/perifery.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/4421386252/Screenshot%202=
025-08-22%20at%2011.15.11%E2%80%AFAM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
=3D1755875745857&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"453" dat=
a-width=3D"633" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=
