e=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2025-08-2=
2 at 11.15.11=E2=80=AFAM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.n=
et/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resour=
ce-container-id=3D"4421386252" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"2"=
 data-media-id=3D"54f29cf9-e269-4aa5-9853-82504d736770" data-media-type=3D"=
file" height=3D"335"></span>
<p>Start with transcribe-summarize, click on it, and then click the =E2=80=
=9CService Config=E2=80=9D , and select =E2=80=9CRabbitMQ=E2=80=9D</p><span=
