<p></p>
<p></p>
<p>NOTE: for the cert files, we have both loaded in the ai+ node, default i=
s to Dev01 node, override this to point to Dev02 by appending =E2=80=9C_dev=
2=E2=80=9D before the file extension.</p>
<p>Dev01 settings:</p>
<p>/etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/ca.crt</p>
<p>/etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/tls.crt</p>
<p>/etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/tls.key</p>
<p>Dev02 settings:</p>
<p>/etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/ca_dev2.crt</p>
<p>/etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/tls_dev2.crt</p>
<p>/etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/tls_dev2.key</p>
<p></p>
<p>Step 4 - Click Save, and start up TranscribeSummarize</p>
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper=
 confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image i=
mage-center" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"3c2b015e4a9e25b31e6ee2e3=
1043a3bf92c6b5232fd03f8b5a8af16bcfd981e6" data-image-src=3D"https://perifer=
y.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/4421386252/Screenshot%202025-08-2=
2%20at%2011.24.23%E2%80%AFAM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1755876=
276701&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"492" data-width=3D=
"860" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"442145=
1784" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2025-08-22 at 11.24=
.23=E2=80=AFAM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.net/wiki" d=
ata-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-contain=
er-id=3D"4421386252" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"2" data-medi=
a-id=3D"62eb934d-d25e-4bbc-ad19-8a12d254721b" data-media-type=3D"file" heig=
ht=3D"267"></span>
<p>Go to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://10.20.1.73:8080/servers"=
 rel=3D"nofollow">http://10.20.1.73:8080/servers</a> , and press the start =
button for that service.</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p>Step 5 - Repeat steps 3-4 for NotificationAPI.</p>
<p></p>
<p>Step 6 - Test/ Validate via Vision UI.</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
